Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:24.04,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey. Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.06,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.70,Main,A Zarude,0,0,0,,All right! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:54.38,Main,A Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah! There! Get ‘im!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:04.31,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey! What’s that you have there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.98,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,About that... \N I need to talk with the Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:17.45,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Did you forget that no one else \N is allowed on our turf?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:20.37,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:24.87,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You have brought us \N another curiosity.{Was curious about the ‘mata’ since the first time hearing this - given later context, wonder if this is supposed to be foreshadowing that Dadazarude was the first ‘rare thing’ -blu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.12,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:31.31,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,A human? A child, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:34.13,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,A human? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.93,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Yech! \N It smells like a Skunpuu’s rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.33,0:04:47.43,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,So, what do you \N mean to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.65,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:54.99,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But didn’t you all \N hear that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:05:00.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If I left him alone, \N he’d probably die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.99,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,That doesn’t concern us! \N The law is absolute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.78,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,I’ll get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:11.93,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,Respect the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:11.93,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,{\an8}Get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:12.96,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:18.41,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,“Water soaks into the earth. \N The trees grow tall.{Okite no Uta lyrics. Make sure they be consistent. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:20.42,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,“Light shines on them. \N The forest is born.”{Okite no Uta lyrics. Make sure they be consistent. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:25.39,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,The water from the Sacred Tree \N nurtures us, the Zarude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:31.60,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,To allow anyone else on our land \N is to allow ourselves to wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.93,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,That is the law of Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.69,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:36.71,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,Get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.43,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,Obey the law!{As well as the ‘okite ni shitagee!’(Obey the law!) in channel 2, there’s another ‘temee .. sutechimae!(?)’ in channel 3? -blu}{Hmmm... With barely-audible background lines like these I don't think it's really all THAT important. We already have A Zarude shouting to "get rid of it!" anyway. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:41.40,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,No need to yell. \N I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.16,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Then hurry up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:48.16,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’ll find his parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.37,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.27,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m leaving the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.42,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Do you understand \N what that means?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:59.21,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The law will no longer \N apply to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:03.09,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,You’ll never be let into our land again! \N You’ll no longer be one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.52,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,We cannot stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.45,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,What a crazy guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:17.11,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,I actually trusted you, \N you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:19.73,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:21.70,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:46.68,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is Milyfa{Presumably an anagram of “Family,” to go along with the jungle being called “Okoya Jungle” as an anagram of “oyako (Parent and child)” -Starfish} Town, \N a small town surrounded by jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:51.14,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Satoshi travels with his partner, Pikachu, \N in the hopes of becoming a Pokémon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:56.63,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,They plan to explore the vast Okoya Jungle, \N seeking new adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll be going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.31,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:04.90,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:06.86,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Do you have everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:09.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Sure do! I’ll be fine! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:10.82,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.13,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,It’s at times like these \N that I {\i1}really{\i} get worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.63,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Do you have Potions? \N Clean clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:17.02,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Food for Pika-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You worry too much, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.17,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Parents always worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:23.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Fine, I got it. \N I’m hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.17,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Watch your tone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:28.33,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I don’t know {\i1}what{\i0} I’d do \N if anything happened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:30.05,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh! Someone’s calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:40.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,If I let Mom go on any longer, \N we’d be there all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.69,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Look, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:47.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s the jungle! It’s huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:56.16,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:58.87,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Wait, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.65,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,The berries over there \N were almost ready to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.04,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,No need to rush. \N It’s not like they’re gonna run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.50,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I don’t know, \N you can never be sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:07.72,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:17.41,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,What’s up, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.69,0:10:20.18,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.52,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I can’t hear you \N if you all talk at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.94,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Is there a problem, Koko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:31.15,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:35.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:41.76,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.21,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,What’s...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.30,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,They came \N all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.56,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Oh, quit whining! \N I had nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:09.06,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to \N sharing a meal with my son, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:16.74,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:18.91,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I swear, those guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:20.20,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.50,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’m so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:28.86,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.09,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:35.03,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! That’ll be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:37.89,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,We should make our {\i1}own{\i0} place \N where we can get berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:46.84,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Oh, of course... \N I never even thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.15,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Let’s do it! Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.41,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:52.65,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,These have seeds in them, \N after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.84,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Let’s plant them near our house!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.95,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,{\i1}They{\i0} won’t go there, \N and when the berries are ripe,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.87,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,we can share them with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.87,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Great idea, son! {SASUGA. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.01,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Okay! Now that we’ve \N got it all figured out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:07.27,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Let’s grab as many seeds \N as we can carry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:08.22,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.62,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Look at that, Pikachu! \N It’s swallowing it whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Isn’t that cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:25.37,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Okay! Let’s just go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:27.39,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.52,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:36.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! \N Use 100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Now, Monster B—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Darn it... \N What a cool Pokémon, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.88,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Pikachu’s merciless, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:59.62,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Well, if he couldn’t even take on {\i1}that{\i0} thing, \N he wouldn’t be worthy of Team Rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.62,0:13:04.39,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,But even we haven’t been \N shocked from the {\i1}inside{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.89,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,It hurts just to think about, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.77,Main,Sonansu,0,0,0,,Sonansu!{Movie. Counts as a new project. Therefore Sonansu’s quirk must be TL Noted once more. -Starfish}{Hmm... Did it get marked in (2019)? -blu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.77,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur3\pos(640,638)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Ooh! Found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s be more careful this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Whoa...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It sure is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.07,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll catch this one, for su—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:25.53,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.58,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:30.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Nope, I’m fine! \N Look, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:35.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Slump...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:37.51,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I don’t suppose you happen to be \N a Pokémon Trainer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:38.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:41.14,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m Satoshi, from Masara Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,And this guy is \N my partner, Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.65,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I’m Karen, a researcher for \N the Biotope Company.{Given her name, this lady is remarkably non-awful. (Yes, I know the "Karen" meme is strictly a western thing and the name doesn't have any particularly awful connotations in Japan.) -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:51.94,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Researcher?! \N What kinda research do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:56.19,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We’re siphoning{ up} some of the water here \N and analyzing its composition. {is this Mewtwo Saga all over again? —Puto}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Its composition, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:01.37,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Oh, that brat boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:03.25,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,There’s no way he knows \N what that is, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.40,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,So? \N What {\i1}are{\i0} they researching?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.66,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Oh, found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:10.22,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,“We at the Biotope Company...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:17.09,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,“...employ state-of-the-art research to create a future where \N humans and Pokémon may live in harmony.”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.04,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,That’s one heck of \N a company, meow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.43,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:21.45,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.47,0:14:25.18,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,“Team representative \N Doctor Zed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:30.49,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,“...resumes search for spring \N with healing powers,” it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:32.11,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,A healing spring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:33.96,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Does that even exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:35.59,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:39.22,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Looks like they have plenty of stuff \N that may be of use to Team Rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:42.42,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,And if we can report that to Sakaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:52.54,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.38,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:11.16,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:14.23,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Won’t be ready to eat \N anytime soon, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I wonder when \N {\i1}my{\i0} vines will grow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.52,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Come on, \N you’re just fine without ‘em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:25.72,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada, you handle the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.88,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.02,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Take me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.61,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Well, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:48.93,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:53.56,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Just calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:54.81,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Break it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.82,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hey... If you were watching, \N you should’ve stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.15,0:16:14.38,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:19.36,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,We have to separate them \N and treat Flygon’s injury, quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:20.82,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Or it may never fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:34.32,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Good... That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,This way, Flygon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:42.25,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,This is gonna be risky... \N But I hope it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.46,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Shh! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:21.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,If you’re all better, \N then let’s get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.69,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,We don’t want {\i1}them{\i0} finding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:25.52,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:28.86,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Who’s “them”?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.53,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Flygon, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.67,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I just borrowed the spring for a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:47.50,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,The spring is {\i1}our{\i0} turf!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:54.97,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} started this \N by stealing {\i1}our{\i0} food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.47,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s only natural that the strong \N will take from the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:18:00.98,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,That’s how it {\i1}should{\i0} be! \N It’s the law of the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:03.27,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Talking about \N that song again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.46,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,That little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.75,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,You think you have any chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.00,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,...Koko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:36.97,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:38.56,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.97,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,There you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.26,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:49.04,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I told you to stay off their turf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:49.72,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:50.94,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Save the excuses for later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:54.07,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,You think you can just stroll in here \N and get away with it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:58.11,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I know he shouldn’t have!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.54,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m taking him with me \N and leaving right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:02.36,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Elder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:06.47,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m sorry! \N I’ll make sure he never does it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.04,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.62,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,The law is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:13.28,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,We must stay vigilant, \N lest we be caught unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:14.63,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:17.37,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Come on, Koko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:19.89,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,The Elder has always \N been soft on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.55,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I can’t believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:38.16,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Me? They were the ones \N taking all the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.26,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The Zarude have their own law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.99,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,A law to keep them alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:46.15,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Does that mean \N the other Pokémon don’t matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.89,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,They don’t know how great \N the Pokémon of the forest are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:53.16,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Flygon is quick to pick fights, \N but it’s strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:55.22,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Tekkanin is amazingly quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:58.18,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,And when Monmen stick to something, \N they never let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.30,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it. Just come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.26,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:07.84,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Was what I did that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:09.77,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,It was to the Zarude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,But I’m not a Zarude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:16.45,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,That’s why I don’t \N understand the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:19.11,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,My hands, my body... \N I’m not even the same color...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.73,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Wrong! You {\i1}are{\i0} a Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:24.16,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Then why can’t I use \N any moves at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:26.13,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,What am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:29.12,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:35.05,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:47.32,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,He’s never put his own safety first \N when a Pokémon needed help...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:52.54,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.82,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.24,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Washibon! Washibon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.00,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Koko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:05.19,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.61,0:21:09.59,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,He’s not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:18.90,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Say... \N Who do I look like to you?{Hoshigarisu: “Koko.”}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.97,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,That’s not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:35.28,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,If I’m not a Zarude, \N then what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:37.92,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Who am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:15.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:18.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He’s alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:21.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hang in there. I’ll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:39.46,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Nothing detected from the water \N or the sediment at Point B.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.91,0:22:42.40,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Let’s try Point D again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.09,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right away!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:47.87,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,This sample proves that \N the healing spring exists. {oh god, it IS Mewtwo Saga all over again —Puto}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:51.60,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,And so we {\i1}will{\i0} find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:53.27,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We’re almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:22:58.38,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,W-We’re so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:00.79,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We only just \N transferred over from HQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:02.11,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,I’m so sorry, Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.51,0:23:03.37,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:05.08,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We’re fine, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:07.49,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,That’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:10.87,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Everything here \N is vital research material.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:13.06,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.06,0:23:13.97,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:16.26,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,All right. \N Please clean up after yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:17.88,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Yes, right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:21.25,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Please don’t do \N anything uncalled for!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.25,0:23:25.09,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Oh, and I forgot to mention this, \N but the Professor’s room is strictly off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:28.06,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,He really hates having others in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:29.55,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:36.31,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.83,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.09,0:23:45.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:48.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.56,0:23:53.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:58.00,Main,Joy,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:23:59.71,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.75,0:24:05.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.57,0:24:31.66,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Kajirigame!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.15,0:24:34.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Not good! \N We gotta stop it, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.29,0:24:36.25,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.29,0:24:36.25,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}Get outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:40.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Get back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.96,0:24:45.05,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Please move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:56.85,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Morpeko! {Oh no it has infested this movie with its presence 0/10 worst movie ever. -Starfish}{It's Morpeko in its EVIL MODE, too! How on earth is it seemingly being affectionate with that girl?! -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:03.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’re awesome! \N How’d you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.79,0:25:06.28,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Kajirigame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.28,0:25:10.91,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What a surprise... It’s shy around strangers \N and hardly ever opens up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.21,0:25:14.85,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Thank you, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:17.95,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.32,0:25:25.38,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey! How’d you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That thing with Kajirigame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.17,0:25:30.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.47,0:25:37.47,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:48.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Huh? You’re curious \N about Monster Balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.77,0:25:50.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,See here? \N I’ve got ‘em, too.{*proceeds to not demonstrate how they work because he would never recall Pikachu for no reason and these movies are perpetually vague on whether he even HAS other Pokémon with him.* -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:56.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:57.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.65,0:26:00.68,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.77,0:26:12.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:14.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Was that your first time \N seeing a Monster Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.11,0:26:18.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s up, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.85,0:26:24.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What? No way! \N You can talk with Pikachu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.31,0:26:29.98,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.98,0:26:31.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, I’m Satoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:40.95,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Pikachu... Pikapi... {Yeah I’m not sure what to do with Koko’s Pokéspeak in general... I feel like this one at least makes sense to sub but I don’t know where to draw the line with what to include and what to exclude. If y’all would rather NOT include this then that’s fine too I guess. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:43.99,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You really {\i1}can{\i0} talk to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:47.56,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,My name’s “Satoshi,” though...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:49.14,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Sa-to-shi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:50.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.91,0:26:53.86,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,So, what’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:26:59.35,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.96,0:27:02.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’re Koko, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.84,0:27:04.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Nice to meetcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.62,0:28:53.13,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Isn’t it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.48,0:29:01.85,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Uh... What’s up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.46,0:29:04.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.02,0:29:04.99,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:05.74,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.74,0:29:07.12,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Are the fireworks cancelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:09.60,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,If we can’t get these Pokémon \N out of the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:12.34,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.15,0:29:15.96,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Sheesh... \N What’s their problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:17.64,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.64,0:29:20.71,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,We were getting tonight’s \N fireworks show ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.71,0:29:22.79,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,but then these guys \N butted in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:23.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.74,0:29:26.08,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Wish I knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:29.04,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,We’re running out of time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.63,0:29:39.05,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Hey, kid! Get down from there! \N It’s dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.05,0:29:41.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,H-H-Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.30,0:29:41.96,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.96,0:29:44.55,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He can understand Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.55,0:29:46.16,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What? That’s not possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.16,0:29:47.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,No, it’s true!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.76,0:29:50.00,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He must have \N figured something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.56,0:30:02.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.74,0:30:05.42,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Hey! Turn off the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.42,0:30:06.20,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.20,0:30:07.33,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.30,0:30:09.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Huh? What’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.46,0:30:11.54,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, wai—{Retimed this to end on the Keyframe That Isn't A Keyframe because I felt like it stuck around for a bit long before and this just FEELS ore right to me. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:20.17,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Everybody pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.17,0:30:22.36,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Slowly! Carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:27.77,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,There’s a kid on \N the other end of this rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.77,0:30:30.80,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Don’t let it snap! \N Pull slowly! Slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:33.73,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.73,0:30:38.71,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,I see... \N One of the Tairetsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.71,0:30:42.63,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,So that’s why you were trying to stop them \N from launching the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.45,0:30:46.33,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,I may not have known,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.33,0:30:48.95,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,but still, I’m sorry \N for how I acted, Tairetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.66,0:30:56.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.62,0:31:09.26,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What an odd fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.26,0:31:12.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, it’s just fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.49,0:31:18.99,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Fire... works...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.79,0:31:23.57,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:26.60,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,Another marvelous show this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.60,0:31:29.49,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Thank you. \N We owe it all to these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.49,0:31:31.37,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,They rescued the Tairetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.37,0:31:33.40,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.40,0:31:36.99,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,I am truly grateful \N for what you did. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.54,0:31:42.60,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we were able to \N launch our wishes to Celebi again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Celebi? The Mythical Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.26,0:31:47.51,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Yeah. Celebi’s the guardian deity \N of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.51,0:31:49.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Does that mean \N I can meet Celebi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:53.40,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,I’m sorry to say, but we haven’t seen it \N for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:54.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.90,0:31:59.09,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,They say Celebi only shows itself \N in peaceful times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.09,0:32:01.11,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,So if it disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:05.53,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,that might mean that something bad \N is transpiring in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.53,0:32:07.04,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.04,0:32:09.74,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,But there is a tale which says this...{was:But there is a tale that goes like this...}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.74,0:32:17.11,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,When Celebi disappears, \N it may leave behind an egg, deep within the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:21.74,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,The egg is said to be something \N Celebi brought from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.74,0:32:23.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,From the future? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:26.04,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,‘Tis but a folktale.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.04,0:32:30.52,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,We merely wish for \N Celebi to return to the jungle,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:35.89,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,and for the people and Pokémon to have \N a bright future to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.89,0:32:38.65,Main,Mayor,0,0,0,,That is what the fireworks symbolize.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:53.84,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.84,0:32:55.45,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Oh, it’s just you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.28,0:33:16.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh, that father and son? \N What about ‘em?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.56,0:33:14.13,Main,Child,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wanna see ‘em again!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.13,0:33:16.85,Main,Father,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah. Let’s come see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.85,0:33:18.30,Main,Child,0,0,0,,I wanna see ‘em tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.30,0:33:22.38,Main,Father,0,0,0,,Getting a little enthusiastic there. \N The next show won’t be until after you turn six.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.38,0:33:23.73,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Father and son...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:27.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:31.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Wh-What’s wrong, Koko?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:34.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Are you looking for someone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.71,0:33:41.64,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi! {Pokémon noises!}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.29,0:33:47.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Wait... You mean you want me \N to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.84,0:34:07.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, Koko... \N How far are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.17,0:34:27.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.74,0:34:35.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.08,0:34:36.03,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi! {Pokémon noises...}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.38,0:34:46.94,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,A Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.78,0:34:49.69,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Koko... Father and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.08,0:34:52.51,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Your dad’s... a Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.71,0:34:56.12,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You just spoke human language.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.12,0:34:58.45,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,First you run off, \N then you come back with a human...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.45,0:35:00.72,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:06.42,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You knew, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:09.38,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’m a “human,” aren’t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.89,0:35:15.34,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada! Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:19.43,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’m a human like him! \N Not a Zarude, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.43,0:35:21.31,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,No! You {\i1}are{\i0} a Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:22.73,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Don’t lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.59,0:35:29.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Owww...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.74,0:35:31.40,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What do you think, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.71,0:35:34.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,They really do look like \N father and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.36,0:35:39.90,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I brought Satoshi because \N I wanted you to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:42.54,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,There were lots of others \N who looked like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:45.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,They shot these sparkly things \N into the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.06,0:35:47.14,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,the humans and Pokémon \N watched it together,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.14,0:35:49.30,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,and they were all smiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.89,0:35:57.84,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,The Zarude can’t do that, \N can they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.84,0:36:00.09,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You taught me everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.09,0:36:03.18,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,How to get food... How to run... \N How to leap...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.92,0:36:08.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Why... Why didn’t you teach me \N about humans?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.59,0:36:11.81,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to make you sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.81,0:36:12.69,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.27,0:36:19.70,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I always thought I was weird \N for getting along with the other Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.22,0:36:23.54,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,But I had it wrong. \N It was because I was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.04,0:36:28.17,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,If I get to be friends with Pokémon, \N then I’d rather be human!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.27,0:36:38.33,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I knew this day would come \N sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.41,0:36:40.84,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:45.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You are human, \N and I’m not your real father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:46.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But I still—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.03,0:36:47.81,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Who am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.57,0:36:57.71,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.39,0:37:04.69,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Hey. Looks like this research was \N put on ice at one point, ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:05.33,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.99,0:37:08.26,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Seems there was an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.26,0:37:09.58,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,An accident, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.26,0:37:13.21,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Talk about strict security.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:16.47,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Looks like there’s no way in \N aside from the director’s PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.47,0:37:21.31,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Remember how they said we couldn’t enter his room? \N Sounds pretty fishy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.31,0:37:24.03,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,He’s totally hiding something!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:34.40,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I first met you on a rainy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.08,0:37:38.25,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You were all alone, \N lying in a strange container.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.90,0:37:42.14,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I didn’t see anyone \N who could be your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.14,0:37:44.95,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You had this on you at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.71,0:37:51.79,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Why did you take me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.64,0:37:54.04,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:57.07,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Maybe because \N I didn’t have parents either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.07,0:37:59.74,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I don’t even know \N how I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.74,0:38:02.24,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I saw myself in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:04.97,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I couldn’t abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.20,0:38:19.20,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You’re the baby in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.77,0:38:23.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The bigger humans \N are your real parents, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.29,0:38:26.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,They look just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.30,0:38:29.97,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere \N to try and find your real parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.97,0:38:31.86,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,and found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:35.58,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,This was probably their nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.03,0:38:39.41,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,but it was already abandoned \N when I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.14,0:38:43.59,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,So I thought I’d just have to \N raise you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.31,0:38:48.60,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Looking back now, \N that might’ve been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.11,0:38:51.87,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I ended up making you sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.90,0:38:57.68,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,That’s all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.04,0:39:04.41,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you. \N Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.08,0:39:09.95,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:15.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:20.96,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Nice and slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.96,0:39:22.92,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,What’s your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.25,0:39:25.60,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Okay! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.60,0:39:27.18,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,‘Kay, lemme do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.18,0:39:30.68,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Now, let’s see what’s in \N that director guy’s room!{technically extends later (shochou~ no o~heya~) but a8’ing one would make it harder to follow, so eh -blu}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.68,0:39:33.15,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Be careful! \N We only have one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.15,0:39:34.73,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I know, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.06,0:39:39.65,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Wait a sec... Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.65,0:39:43.74,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:50.93,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:51.69,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Just barely...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.69,0:39:53.34,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,...got it, meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.41,0:39:58.93,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,It’s the thing that \N swallowed Pikachu, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.87,0:40:04.47,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Nooo! \N Let go of my arm, you stupid thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.59,0:40:08.11,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Gross! It’s all slimy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.11,0:40:11.28,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,No way, no way! \N Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.28,0:40:12.62,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Stay away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.31,0:40:18.02,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Oh... I hate this...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.02,0:40:20.62,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,What was up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.46,0:40:26.70,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}The caaaaard!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:36.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Watching you guys reminded me \N of a chat I had with my dad once.{OH MY GOD SATOSHI HAS A DAD WHAT DEEP INTERESTING LIGHTS MAY THIS SHINE ON HIS PAST?! -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.48,0:40:42.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,When I was little, my friends laughed at my dream, \N and I was really down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.19,0:40:44.42,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Then my dad told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.42,0:40:48.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,“The map to your goal \N is inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.90,0:40:51.89,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,“If you give up, \N your dream won’t ever come true.”
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.61,0:40:56.89,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,After all my travels with Pikachu, \N I think I finally get what he meant.{Truly, we have learned a lot about Satoshi’s character in the past thirty seconds. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.45,0:41:01.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’ll be fine. \N You’re family, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.93,0:41:05.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Even if you fight, \N you’ll be back to normal before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.46,0:41:10.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Family sure is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.78,0:41:17.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.46,0:41:24.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Are you looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.72,0:41:35.72,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I getcha! You wanna find \N something of your parents’...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:38.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll help you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.58,0:41:46.40,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s gotta be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.33,0:41:50.60,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I met someone \N wearing this symbol today!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.29,0:41:57.52,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,They gotta know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.27,0:41:59.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.17,0:42:01.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Gonna go?{was:Going?}{In this scene “coming” would be more appropriate but these two words are repeated several times throughout and there’s at least one place where it *has* to be “Going” and I feel like we should keep it consistent. -Starfish}{If he can say ‘father and son’ already at this point... Tried to make it something less weird but still consistent.  -blu}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.57,0:42:03.83,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Koko...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.83,0:42:05.07,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,...gonna go!{was:...going!}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.26,0:42:16.14,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You came all the way out here? \N That’s not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.72,0:42:20.72,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You told him the truth, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.31,0:42:23.55,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I should’ve told him \N from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.17,0:42:25.90,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Should you have, now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.67,0:42:29.56,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I wonder... What {\i1}is{\i0} a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.40,0:42:34.14,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I didn’t even know my parents, \N let alone how to be one myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.75,0:42:41.43,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen Celebi \N for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.43,0:42:42.55,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Celebi?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.55,0:42:44.65,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,The last time I saw it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.65,0:42:50.53,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,...shortly before \N you came to me, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.53,0:42:52.67,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You trying to say it’s my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.63,0:42:56.30,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:02.52,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Celebi disappearing... \N You showing up...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.52,0:43:05.50,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You taking in Koko \N as your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.50,0:43:08.48,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t you think \N there has to be a reason for it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.55,0:43:14.61,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You have your own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.30,0:43:18.95,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Only the Sacred Tree \N knows the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.13,0:43:34.11,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,The spring! \N We have to take him to the spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.11,0:43:36.09,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,No! You’d put {\i1}yourself{\i0} \N in danger, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.59,0:43:38.41,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I can’t let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:41.90,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,But a Pokémon right here \N in front of me needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.90,0:43:43.85,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I can’t just ignore him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.57,0:43:47.70,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.95,0:43:53.02,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Give him to me. \N There is one way we can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.02,0:43:54.08,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.08,0:43:56.61,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah. Step back for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.86,0:44:29.10,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.56,0:44:30.81,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.81,0:44:34.30,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah. That move’s just \N a little exhausting to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.80,0:44:44.17,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Washibon’s gotten better!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.20,0:44:47.66,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada, that was incredible! \N How’d you do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.66,0:44:48.64,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.64,0:44:53.65,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s a cool move that \N only a few Zarude can pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.65,0:44:57.21,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I wished to the jungle. \N And it lent me its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.21,0:45:01.86,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But if I use it too much, \N it’ll be the death of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.86,0:45:05.32,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,So I only use it \N when it’s absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:06.68,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.95,0:45:51.02,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Here, have some \N delicious Pokémon food.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.02,0:45:53.37,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,It’s not here anymore, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.37,0:45:54.99,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,You might be right \N about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.99,0:45:57.39,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Well, then we just have to \N look {\i1}everywhere!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.72,0:46:02.37,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,It’s the brat boy, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.37,0:46:03.89,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,What’s he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.89,0:46:05.49,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.95,0:46:12.76,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,All right, come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.68,0:46:15.24,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Look at all the machines!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.24,0:46:16.67,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Not a common sight, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.67,0:46:17.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.96,0:46:20.44,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,Careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.78,0:46:22.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Sit down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.01,0:46:27.35,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.93,0:46:29.93,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I am the director \N of this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.93,0:46:31.67,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,My name is Zed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.67,0:46:33.52,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I heard you had questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.52,0:46:37.38,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah! I’m Satoshi. \N This is my partner, Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.98,0:46:39.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,And this is Koko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.90,0:46:41.90,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.55,0:46:44.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We’re looking for these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.67,0:46:45.66,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.13,0:46:49.41,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We thought maybe \N they were here in this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.89,0:46:52.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I think they’re \N Koko’s real parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.74,0:46:54.69,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,so I’d like for him meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.69,0:46:56.92,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Where did you find this photo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.72,0:47:00.84,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Is that really Al...?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.77,0:47:03.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.76,0:47:07.86,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It’s a photo of \N Mr. and Mrs. Molybden.{WOW that name. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.86,0:47:10.20,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,They were once \N in charge of this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.20,0:47:14.57,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,And the child in their arms \N is their son, Al Molybden.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:19.49,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,They led the research \N on the healing spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.49,0:47:22.77,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,The very existence of the spring \N was a legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.77,0:47:28.62,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,and though many researchers tried, \N no one was able to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:35.58,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,But the two of them found it in this jungle, \N and were able to retrieve a sample of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.51,0:47:42.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.10,0:47:44.13,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.35,0:47:46.81,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.81,0:47:51.06,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Yes. That pendant is, \N without a doubt, Molybden’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.57,0:47:53.19,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Karen, bring the scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.19,0:47:53.86,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.37,0:47:57.37,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Can I see it, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.95,0:48:00.07,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.07,0:48:04.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko was raised by Pokémon, \N so he doesn’t really understand human speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.43,0:48:05.99,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.07,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Raised by Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.07,0:48:11.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Meaning he can speak Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.12,0:48:12.58,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.58,0:48:14.28,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Here, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.28,0:48:15.26,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:22.38,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We can find out if you really are Al \N if we investigate that pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.38,0:48:25.34,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N It’s not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.06,0:48:31.15,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It’s all right. I won’t take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.15,0:48:31.89,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.65,0:48:36.40,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,The biometrics match.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.40,0:48:37.51,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.27,0:48:39.06,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.68,0:48:41.98,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,There is something he must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.30,0:48:47.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,The Molybdens are not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.36,0:48:51.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,They passed away ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.28,0:48:52.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.25,0:48:54.47,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.29,0:48:57.68,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It was a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.30,0:49:02.17,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We lost the two of them, all their data, \Nand Al was nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.90,0:49:06.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We thought for sure that he, too, \N had perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.28,0:49:10.68,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,But you survived. \N It’s nothing short of a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.22,0:49:20.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He said these two are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.86,0:49:28.50,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Miss Karen, the data...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.50,0:49:29.32,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:32.34,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Professor, the data...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.34,0:49:33.07,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.50,0:49:34.98,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Bring it up on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.98,0:49:35.86,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.86,0:49:37.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.53,0:49:41.87,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It seems some data we thought to be lost \N was stored in Al’s pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.87,0:49:45.23,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Most of the data was corrupt, \N but a single image survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.23,0:49:46.25,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.69,0:49:49.61,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.47,0:49:53.05,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,{\fad(0, 394)}The healing spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.89,0:50:04.72,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko, what’s up?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.72,0:50:07.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Do you know something \N about the spring?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.28,0:50:10.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s right! \N Because Koko lives in the jungle...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.36,0:50:11.60,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.60,0:50:14.12,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,If you know something, \N won’t you please tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.12,0:50:17.87,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,For the sake of the dream \N your parents could not fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.00,0:50:25.95,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.47,0:50:28.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.73,0:50:31.38,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I have to go. I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.34,0:50:34.36,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.90,0:50:38.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.43,0:50:40.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Wait, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.43,0:50:42.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.73,0:50:46.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:33.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Which way’d they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.49,0:51:36.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All around, there’s nothing but \N trees, trees, and more trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.66,0:51:38.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You got anything, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.12,0:51:40.51,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.81,0:51:46.46,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.99,0:51:49.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’re... Where’s Koko?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.96,0:52:01.63,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Those people knew me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.16,0:52:07.98,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Why did you leave me in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:11.74,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Didn’t you want to leave me \N with those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.74,0:52:14.63,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Did you really have no choice \N but to leave me in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.66,0:52:23.98,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,What’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.21,0:52:34.27,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,It’s him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.29,0:52:51.03,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,It {\i1}was{\i0} real!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.03,0:52:52.02,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.02,0:52:52.87,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.87,0:52:54.36,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,We finally found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.41,0:52:57.37,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Yes. \N There’s no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.89,0:53:00.95,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,The healing spring... \N This is its source!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.83,0:53:03.54,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Hey, isn’t that tree...?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.54,0:53:05.50,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Looks just like the photo, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.95,0:53:14.70,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Oh, Al. \N This is all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.70,0:53:16.46,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Please don’t think badly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.89,0:53:25.86,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Well... I guess there’s \N no point in saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.86,0:53:30.15,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I’m sorry it had to be this way, \N but you must understand this is very important...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.22,0:53:38.07,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Professor, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.42,0:53:41.85,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We have no choice. \N Let’s have him accompany us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.39,0:53:44.85,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We don’t want him \N attacking us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.91,0:54:12.73,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.25,0:54:16.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What are you doing, \N Professor Zed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.65,0:54:21.18,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I apologize, \N but I made good use of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.18,0:54:24.84,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I finally found a clue to \N what I’ve sought for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.72,0:54:30.75,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’re wondering \N why we came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.75,0:54:32.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,‘Cause you’re my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.65,0:54:34.34,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.22,0:54:49.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.35,0:54:51.31,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Please, forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:55.96,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Don’t cause trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.87,0:54:57.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.51,0:55:00.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.49,0:55:04.22,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I leave the children to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.22,0:55:05.14,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:09.65,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Why should we hafta?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.65,0:55:11.28,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,No, this is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.28,0:55:12.11,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.11,0:55:14.07,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Where is Pikachu right now, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.07,0:55:15.39,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Inside the truck, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.39,0:55:18.35,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,So if we just nab the whole truck...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.35,0:55:19.52,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.52,0:55:22.11,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Ooooh, you guys are {\i1}evil!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.04,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,Heh, heh, and more heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.14,0:55:48.30,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Elder, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.77,0:55:51.59,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Would you go have a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:52.70,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Yes! Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.17,0:56:00.85,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We’ll nab both \N the key {\i1}and{\i0} Pikachu, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.85,0:56:03.17,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,But how do we get it \N to spit it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.17,0:56:05.96,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Just shove your hand \N down its throat and...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.96,0:56:07.33,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Don’t make any sudden moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.33,0:56:09.53,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna do that, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.53,0:56:10.89,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Who’ll do it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.77,0:56:17.71,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Say, are you thinking \N what I’m thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.71,0:56:22.05,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,But then we’d have to \N let Pikachu out, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.05,0:56:24.00,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Our hardest choice ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.00,0:56:26.30,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?! \N We get the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.91,0:56:29.72,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We’ll have plenty more chances \N to nab Pikachu,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.72,0:56:33.84,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,but if we wanna enter that room, \N now’s our best chance since everyone’s out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.84,0:56:35.93,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,I see... That does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.93,0:56:38.52,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,All right, then let’s strike \N while the iron’s hot, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.74,0:56:59.49,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,What do I do, Dada...?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.65,0:57:04.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,No good...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.85,0:57:06.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, your tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.34,0:57:08.55,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll just chew this off, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.41,0:57:10.22,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi...?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.22,0:57:13.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Koko! \N We’ll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.75,0:57:17.75,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The Pokémon, your dad,{Remember: While WE have heard Koko call Dada Zarude... “Dada” a bunch of times, Satoshi heard none of that because they were speaking in Pokémonish. So he would not know what Koko calls him. -Starfish}{Not to mention Satoshi says otou-san and not tou-chan. - Toa}\N and the whole jungle...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.75,0:57:19.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,There’s no way I’ll ever \N give up on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:27.51,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey, what’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.51,0:57:29.34,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,That’s what I wanna know!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.61,0:57:33.43,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,The way they’re going, \N they gotta be headed for the Sacred Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.88,0:57:36.52,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Tell the Elder about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.52,0:57:37.52,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.52,0:57:39.09,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,I’ll stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.09,0:57:40.01,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.19,0:57:44.13,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Now, then... What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.13,0:57:47.03,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Why don’t we go all out, \N like old times?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.13,0:57:49.14,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.14,0:57:52.09,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Besides, if we don’t, \N {\i1}we’ll{\i0} be done for!{This could either be “We disappear” or “Our home disappears”... but as previously established, the Zarude consider these to be the same thing. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.29,0:57:59.41,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.03,0:58:06.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.65,0:58:09.73,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.73,0:58:10.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.48,0:58:15.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,There. You’re okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.97,0:58:17.14,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Hoshigarisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.85,0:58:22.55,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.80,0:58:25.99,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,The Professor \N wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.64,0:58:28.19,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,He’s on the car radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.19,0:58:29.44,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,I’ll keep watch for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.44,0:58:31.61,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.33,0:58:44.04,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,H-Hey, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.04,0:58:45.12,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We’re good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.12,0:58:46.34,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,We only have one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.34,0:58:48.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, again!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.02,0:58:50.13,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.42,0:58:57.17,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.17,0:58:57.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.80,0:59:11.67,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi! {Pokémon noises!}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.32,0:59:14.55,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:16.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Um... Mind if we run?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.21,0:59:18.21,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.21,0:59:19.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.84,0:59:22.37,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,No, thank {\i1}you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.14,0:59:25.21,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Hey! {why is there always a running gag where pokémon like chewing on Kojiro’s head? —Puto}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.09,0:59:33.00,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.10,0:59:42.20,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What’s that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.20,0:59:43.03,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,The Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.03,0:59:44.35,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,They’re attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.35,0:59:45.90,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Stay put! Do {\i1}not{\i0} come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.90,0:59:47.36,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Why are they attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.36,0:59:48.77,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.02,1:00:13.30,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Dada... \N Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.05,1:00:23.19,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.19,1:00:24.31,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.31,1:00:25.48,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,This ain’t good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.63,1:00:28.52,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:30.68,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Pay them no mind. \N Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.68,1:00:32.44,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,They’re only Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.44,1:00:35.11,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,They’ll flee as soon as \N they recognize the danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.76,1:00:45.02,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Stay away from my Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.02,1:00:46.09,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.38,1:00:49.43,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.43,1:00:51.02,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.42,1:00:53.52,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,You truly are a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.52,1:00:55.95,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Could that be the Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.95,1:00:57.40,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,...who raised Al?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.40,1:00:59.05,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Get out of here, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.05,1:00:59.55,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.04,1:01:16.28,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor, please think \N about what you’re doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.64,1:01:19.78,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I do not need you \N to understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.39,1:01:21.63,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.63,1:01:22.95,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.66,1:01:25.01,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.61,1:01:42.32,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,So, shall we have a look?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.32,1:01:44.00,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Treasure! Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.00,1:01:47.31,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Samples, classified information... \N Anything’s good!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.43,1:01:52.68,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Elder!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.68,1:01:54.75,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.17,1:01:58.36,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,It was the humans \N who were hurting the forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.73,1:02:02.37,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,My wounds aren’t too bad, \N but his...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.37,1:02:06.81,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,I don’t know why, \N but that child fought by our side.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.81,1:02:09.80,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko called him “Friend.” {Literally “It seems he is Koko’s ‘friend.’” And yes, the CCs do have quotation marks around it. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.37,1:02:14.00,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Our first priority must be \N to preserve the forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.00,1:02:15.21,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.03,1:02:20.22,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,It’s quite striking up close...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.62,1:02:23.53,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Indeed! It is truly beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.53,1:02:26.85,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Professor! The Pokémon from before \N are over there...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.70,1:02:29.20,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,This is their nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.30,1:02:34.79,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Professor! \N It matches the sample!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:37.90,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We did it! \N We’ve got the coordinates{literally “location data” -Starfish}, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.43,1:02:40.91,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Scan that great tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.91,1:02:41.58,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.58,1:02:42.15,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.15,1:02:42.88,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Ah... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.57,1:02:49.79,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I don’t believe it...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.79,1:02:53.04,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I’m getting immense \N energy readings from inside the tree!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.04,1:02:55.54,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,That is the healing power.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.54,1:02:56.06,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.53,1:02:59.26,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Fire the anchors \N into that great tree!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.26,1:03:01.05,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,What... Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.05,1:03:02.32,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.32,1:03:02.97,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.97,1:03:04.47,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Oh, no... Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.89,1:03:15.86,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Now they’ve done it...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.82,1:03:19.53,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,The Sacred Tree...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.09,1:03:27.75,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Professor! \N Wasn’t the spring our goal?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.75,1:03:29.54,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Now the Pokémon will...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.00,1:03:32.41,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Wrong, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.41,1:03:34.17,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Our goal wasn’t the spring.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.81,1:03:39.91,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,The healing power was simply the energy within the tree, \N dissolved into the water flowing through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.43,1:03:43.30,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,My goal is the tree itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.30,1:03:44.82,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,And for that goal...?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.44,1:03:46.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.95,1:03:49.78,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I will make any sacrifice necessary!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.49,1:03:54.89,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Do they expect us to just {\i1}take{\i0} this?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.89,1:03:57.45,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Everyone who can fight, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.45,1:04:01.00,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s hopeless! \N We can’t beat something that tough!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.40,1:04:04.46,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If we just charge in blindly, \N we’re all done for.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.46,1:04:05.26,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.26,1:04:07.38,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,And the same goes \N if we do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.38,1:04:10.80,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Do you think we can protect \N the Sacred Tree without fighting?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.80,1:04:12.47,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.47,1:04:13.76,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,We are Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:16.48,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,We are the strongest! \N Nothing can scare us!{Okite no Uta lyrics}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.48,1:04:19.75,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,We are the forest’s blood! \N Let out a mighty howl!{Okite no Uta lyrics}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.36,1:04:22.61,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.69,1:04:26.78,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Let’s go! \N One with the Sacred Tree!{Okite no Uta lyrics}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.60,1:04:33.62,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Us, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.05,1:04:36.04,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You rest here, Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.89,1:04:41.50,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You run away with that boy! \N You can never win!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.50,1:04:44.50,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,There’s no way I can just \N abandon everyone in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.50,1:04:46.97,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I don’t want to lose you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.49,1:04:51.18,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna lose you either... \N That’s why I’ll fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.53,1:04:52.22,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.42,1:05:01.86,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Of course... \N you would say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.73,1:05:04.67,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,How can I protect...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.39,1:05:08.61,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...our home... our people...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.21,1:05:10.95,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...and Koko?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.45,1:05:15.27,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.27,1:05:17.29,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You don’t understand! \N He saved him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.29,1:05:19.96,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,That’s right! \N Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.61,1:05:23.25,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Sheesh... \N Didn’t even say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.09,1:05:27.59,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’m glad his dad \N found him, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.48,1:05:30.27,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Parents sure are amazing...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.27,1:05:31.13,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.13,1:05:35.35,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I mean, he came at me \N even though he knew I was a Zarude. {WELL I MEAN HE HAD THE TYPE ADVANTAGE AND AS WE ALL KNOW THAT IS THE ONLY THING THAT MATTERS -Sarcasticfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.35,1:05:38.15,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,He had no idea \N what might happen to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.95,1:05:41.85,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,That Washibon is one lucky kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.50,1:05:43.97,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Would you have done \N the same, Dada?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.69,1:05:46.07,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t know...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.67,1:05:49.34,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,There ain’t nobody \N stronger than me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.34,1:05:50.74,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.36,1:05:55.08,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,680)}But if that time ever comes...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.12,1:05:58.07,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If that time ever comes...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.94,1:06:00.96,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I just gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.96,1:06:04.00,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,But this is going too far!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.41,1:06:06.84,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I’ve put so much thought \N into this...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.84,1:06:08.88,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,More than anyone else here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.25,1:06:10.88,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,So why...?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.25,1:06:14.51,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,{\fad(0, 478)}Humans and Pokémon \N are both living beings.{Hey who put this M1 in my M23?! -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.64,1:06:18.13,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Why does nobody understand \N the right path?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.13,1:06:20.27,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It’s right in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.02,1:06:25.93,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,So, even you...?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.58,1:06:33.43,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Zarude? \N There are so many of them...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.43,1:06:34.49,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Zarude?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.49,1:06:36.50,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,They’ve come back for revenge!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.50,1:06:39.54,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We’ve angered them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.54,1:06:42.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor! \N What have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:45.04,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I’m so sorry! We’ll leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.17,1:06:49.36,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We most certainly will not!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.36,1:06:51.22,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I shall prove that I am right!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.22,1:06:54.14,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Your parents made \N the {\i1}wrong{\i0} choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.01,1:06:58.18,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,And they paid for it \N with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.47,1:07:02.53,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Director, please explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.53,1:07:03.89,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,Zed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.89,1:07:08.89,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,The healing power comes from \N a concentration of energy inside the great tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.89,1:07:12.65,Main,Rin,0,0,0,,But Pokémon named Zarude \N live in that tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.65,1:07:15.87,Main,Rin,0,0,0,,It must be special to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.87,1:07:17.75,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I beg of you to reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.75,1:07:20.95,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,We’ve sought this for so long, \N and finally found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.41,1:07:27.17,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,We’re putting the project on hold until we’ve found \N a solution that works for both people and Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.17,1:07:29.25,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,You’ll give up \N for the Pokémon’s sake?!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.25,1:07:31.24,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,You’re insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.88,1:07:37.01,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,Humans and Pokémon are both living beings. \N They both share the same world.{And now who put this M2 in my M23?! -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.49,1:07:40.12,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,This is the right choice, Zed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.62,1:07:46.01,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,This says it’s a video log \N from ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.01,1:07:47.19,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Huh? Let’s see it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.19,1:07:48.20,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.84,1:07:55.94,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,The healing spring project \N has officially been put on hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.54,1:08:00.86,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,That healing power \N could save so many people...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.51,1:08:04.15,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,But just to appease \N mere Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.11,1:08:09.88,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,He made the wrong choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.33,1:08:18.64,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I could lead the research \N so much better...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.42,1:08:21.45,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I am right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.45,1:08:26.86,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Of course. I just have to get the power \N and {\i1}prove{\i0} that I am right! {GET THE POWER! NINTENDO POWER! —Puto}{It occurs to me that this could be misinterpreted as him saying like "I will prove that I am right by force!" rather than the proper meaning which is "By obtaining the healing power, I will prove that my approach was the right one." -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.86,1:08:29.36,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Yes! That will solve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.05,1:08:32.63,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,If I just get rid of the Molybdens...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.95,1:08:43.62,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Chrom! Rin! \N Where is the data?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.62,1:08:45.06,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,I deleted the data!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.06,1:08:46.25,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.12,1:08:49.67,Main,Chrom,0,0,0,,To protect them!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.67,1:08:51.34,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,You can’t be serious!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.09,1:09:06.27,Main,Rin,0,0,0,,We’re sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.54,1:09:22.74,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.10,1:09:26.04,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,This is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.04,1:09:28.55,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I will not give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.55,1:09:31.75,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,No matter how many years it takes, \N I will revive the research...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.12,1:09:34.62,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,And this time, I will lead it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.58,1:09:43.43,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,And now the time has come!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.85,1:09:45.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,How could he...?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.18,1:09:46.78,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,That’s awful!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:48.98,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I never knew...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.98,1:09:53.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Al. Your survival was a \N most fortunate miscalculation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.28,1:09:57.93,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,But I have no mercy for anyone who defies me, \N you or those Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.69,1:10:13.88,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,H-Hey... you guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.93,1:10:23.44,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.40,1:10:29.02,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If we don’t do something, \N it’s all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.91,1:10:32.32,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.25,1:10:41.82,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:45.46,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I know I have no right \N to ask this of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.78,1:10:49.90,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But I can’t lose Koko.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.08,1:10:54.67,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Because I’m his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.70,1:10:59.63,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I want to protect him, \N whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.06,1:11:04.14,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You guys are Koko’s friends. \N He’s real proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:07.82,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Flygon, you’re quick to pick fights, \N but strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.64,1:11:12.64,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,And Tekkanin, \N he said you were the fastest in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.64,1:11:17.27,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,And that when Monmen stick to something, \N they never let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.43,1:11:21.61,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The Zarude can’t \N win this battle alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.19,1:11:25.84,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But if you help us,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.84,1:11:28.48,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,we can save Koko \N and the forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.21,1:11:30.45,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.92,1:11:34.54,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Fight with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:36.37,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.28,1:11:38.36,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.34,1:11:41.77,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m begging you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.00,1:11:51.39,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Do you really think a handful of Pokémon \N and two children can stop me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.39,1:11:54.81,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Of course we can! \N With people and Pokémon working together!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.81,1:11:56.89,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,No, you cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.89,1:11:58.94,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,History will side with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.52,1:12:04.74,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I will do what \N the Molybdens could not!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.74,1:12:07.24,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.58,1:12:13.80,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.06,1:12:18.29,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,What happened to \N the drive you just had?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.29,1:12:21.52,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Couldn’t Pokémon and humans \N band together to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.34,1:12:37.56,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.37,1:12:40.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He called the Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.31,1:12:45.49,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,“Water soaks into the earth. \N The trees grow tall...”{Okite no Uta lyrics. Though he is technically misquoting them a bit, saying “tsuchi ni shimiru mizu” rather than “tsuchi ni shimikomu mizu” but this doesn’t change the meaning. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.49,1:12:48.96,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,“Light shines down on them. \N The forest is born...”{Moar Okite no Uta -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.65,1:12:53.95,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Now I see. \N The trees were the Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.55,1:12:57.46,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,And {\i1}you{\i0} were the light!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.17,1:13:02.25,Main,A Zarude,0,0,0,,Can you hear \N the army of footsteps?{Okite no Uta}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.55,1:13:08.26,Main,A Zarude,0,0,0,,Can you hear \N the army of voices?{Okite no Uta}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.55,1:13:13.43,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,How... How can they still stand?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.87,1:13:17.44,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,We are the forest’s blood.{Okite no Uta. The next part is new however. -Starfish} \N Let your heartbeats echo!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.44,1:13:20.17,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,One with the Sacred Tree!{Okite no Uta}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.07,1:13:25.51,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,This time, I will finish you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.51,1:13:27.53,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Every last one of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.86,1:13:33.49,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada, what about your wounds? \N Are you really all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:36.37,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Of course I am! \N Who do you think you’re talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.37,1:13:37.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He’s so strong!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.04,1:13:42.46,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,All the Pokémon are \N trying to protect their forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.69,1:14:00.60,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,All of the forest’s Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.60,1:14:03.61,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,...are becoming the roots, \N the flowing blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.61,1:14:07.03,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,And so the forest \N takes its first breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.57,1:14:10.32,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Were we wrong...?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.45,1:14:14.79,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Insolent pests!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.48,1:14:34.85,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Don’t get too carried away, \N you pathetic Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.59,1:14:45.86,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,D-Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.86,1:14:47.13,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You’re...!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.72,1:14:51.86,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,This is nothing. \N As long as you’re safe...!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.71,1:15:04.97,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.97,1:15:07.17,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Take him to the spring, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.17,1:15:08.49,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Give him a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.49,1:15:09.30,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.30,1:15:10.72,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.46,1:15:13.72,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,This will end you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.76,1:15:16.51,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Go, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.51,1:15:19.23,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Don’t let him die!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.23,1:15:21.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We’ll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:24.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I won’t let you take \N Koko’s family{Literally “parent” but who ever says that in this context in English? It sure as hell ain’t a Satoshi thing to say. -Starfish} again!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.70,1:15:41.71,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,How is it, Dada?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.21,1:15:45.36,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:54.84,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Perhaps the Sacred Tree’s water spilling out here \N has caused its power to weaken...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.33,1:15:58.10,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Oh, no... \N Then what do I...?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.47,1:16:01.05,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s fine. Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.71,1:16:04.52,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Please don’t look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.95,1:16:19.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.37,1:16:24.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,How’s that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.19,1:16:33.51,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.76,1:16:37.78,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I was a failure of a father \N till the very end...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.78,1:16:40.77,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...since I couldn’t keep \N that sad look off your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.77,1:16:42.81,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,You’re still saying that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.61,1:16:46.51,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I was never sure...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.51,1:16:49.36,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...if I was a proper father to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.47,1:16:51.40,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.40,1:16:52.90,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.90,1:16:55.18,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m glad that you...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.09,1:16:57.26,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...were my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.78,1:17:00.95,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.61,1:17:05.33,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.30,1:17:10.32,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If someone...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.32,1:17:13.85,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,If someone who’s so strong \N I could never beat them in a fight shows up...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.85,1:17:14.67,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.67,1:17:18.55,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’d protect you any way I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.27,1:17:23.37,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’ll protect {\i1}you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:29.00,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,There’s no way a little runt like you \N could protect me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.00,1:17:32.69,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Sure I can! \N Because I’m your son!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.36,1:17:35.45,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.45,1:17:38.02,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You’re the best son \N I could ask for!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.46,1:17:44.50,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I see... I finally get it...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.71,1:17:48.18,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’ve been your father \N the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.15,1:17:52.00,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Becoming a father...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.76,1:17:57.20,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,...means having someone \N you value more than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.24,1:18:05.23,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.23,1:18:08.10,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’ll save Dada using his move!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.25,1:18:11.48,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko, there’s no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.84,1:18:15.69,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,He told you, didn’t he? \N You are human.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.69,1:18:19.91,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,No! I am a Zarude! \N I’m Dada’s son!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.42,1:18:22.24,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I will save Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.86,1:18:27.21,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I can do it! \N No, I’m the {\i1}only{\i0} one who can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.21,1:18:30.46,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Because I’m Dada’s son!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.04,1:18:45.68,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.64,1:19:02.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s this?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.57,1:19:04.31,Main,Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,That’s his...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.31,1:19:06.01,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,But it smells different.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.77,1:19:07.58,Main,Leader Zarude & Subleader Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.69,1:19:29.14,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,The Pokémon are fighting \N for their lives...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.14,1:19:32.05,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Can we really do nothing \N but watch?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.05,1:19:36.50,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Oh, of course! \N The robot’s control system is located in its back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.50,1:19:38.27,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,If we break that, \N it should stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.27,1:19:39.29,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.29,1:19:40.16,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.16,1:19:40.90,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.90,1:19:42.51,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I heard you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.03,1:19:45.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,There, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.76,1:19:49.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! \N Aim for that big thing’s back!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.78,1:19:51.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.28,1:19:53.37,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.83,1:19:55.75,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I heard your plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.93,1:19:58.54,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.14,1:20:02.96,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Is that the way \N to take him down?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.96,1:20:05.22,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Got it. We’ll take you there!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.47,1:20:07.89,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’ll help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.08,1:20:26.09,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.40,1:20:30.25,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,‘Tis a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.25,1:20:33.00,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You saved me, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:33.79,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.79,1:20:37.66,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Sheesh... \N You’re unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.27,1:20:54.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.11,1:21:04.84,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.84,1:21:05.34,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.34,1:21:05.99,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.49,1:21:09.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.08,1:21:14.77,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Here goes, yellow guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.59,1:21:23.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0, 500)}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.52,1:21:37.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It stopped!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.37,1:21:44.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor! It’s over!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.93,1:21:47.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He’s gone...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.88,1:21:51.37,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,It can’t be over...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.37,1:21:54.45,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Not until I prove I was right...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.55,1:22:03.04,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,You were still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.04,1:22:04.31,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Wait, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.31,1:22:05.55,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Don’t go after him!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.42,1:22:09.89,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s the Elder!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.28,1:22:22.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.28,1:22:26.83,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko, that’s enough! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.83,1:22:27.66,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.66,1:22:30.83,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Koko’s snapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.83,1:22:32.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko! Professor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.66,1:22:35.46,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.16,1:22:52.85,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.85,1:22:54.85,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! \N Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.29,1:22:56.95,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me, Al?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.81,1:23:00.77,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,I refuse to let it end here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.90,1:23:03.68,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Al... Al!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.45,1:23:07.28,Main,Zed,0,0,0,,Al!{My name... is KOKO! -Koko if he could actually say that much}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.13,1:23:25.75,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.30,1:23:32.76,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Yes, just like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.13,1:23:41.75,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.31,1:23:45.38,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,We treated the jungle \N like our own,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.38,1:23:50.45,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,oppressing the Pokémon \N and taking whatever we wanted for ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.91,1:23:55.85,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,What separates us \N from that mad human?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.42,1:23:59.96,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,“The forest’s blood” \N was all the Pokémon living in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.36,1:24:03.21,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The forest couldn’t have \N been restored without its blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.75,1:24:07.06,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,And we, too, \N are the forest’s blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.06,1:24:09.09,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Each and every one of us is needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.09,1:24:11.80,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I think that’s what the \N Song of the Law was trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.39,1:24:23.08,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada! Are you okay now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.08,1:24:24.77,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah! Never better!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.33,1:24:27.90,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,The Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.03,1:24:32.83,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Oh no, Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.83,1:24:33.78,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.78,1:24:38.16,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We promise you, \N and all the Pokémon living in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.16,1:24:41.70,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We will put the forest back to how it was, \N no matter how many years it takes!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.70,1:24:43.78,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I want you to trust us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.67,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Please, Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.19,1:24:48.25,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Miss Karen, they can’t...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.25,1:24:49.54,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,They understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.42,1:25:01.10,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.10,1:25:02.85,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.85,1:25:04.52,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.03,1:25:11.15,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,What an astonishing power...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.62,1:25:18.13,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The Zarude are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.42,1:25:25.83,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right! \N Let’s plant some more trees!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.83,1:25:27.79,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We’ve got so much to do, \N Pikachu!{Shortened the lead-out here to match the song lyrics. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.63,1:25:30.74,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Us, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.74,1:25:31.80,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.13,1:25:41.10,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.60,1:25:45.20,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Who could have seen \N this future coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.20,1:25:49.23,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,...back when he first said \N he would raise you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.23,1:25:50.88,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.74,1:25:55.94,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You connected the people \N and the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.94,1:26:00.37,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone but you could have.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.74,1:26:04.12,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,Because you are both \N human and Zarude.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.12,1:26:07.77,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,You possess the hearts of both.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.77,1:26:09.76,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,That is what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.47,1:26:27.31,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi... gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.31,1:26:32.32,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We got the trees planted way faster than we expected \N thanks to Zarude and the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.32,1:26:34.13,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Does that mean he’s leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.13,1:26:34.82,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.49,1:26:44.83,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi. Koko. Friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.83,1:26:46.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Always!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.67,1:26:49.17,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll come visit!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.96,1:26:52.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,See ya, Koko, Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.49,1:26:57.05,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.93,1:27:02.06,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada? Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.96,1:27:03.93,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.48,1:27:06.00,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I was looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.00,1:27:07.10,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Oh, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.10,1:27:09.49,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I was just talking with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.49,1:27:12.09,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,The Elder wants me back in the pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.09,1:27:13.94,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Along with you, of course!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.94,1:27:18.45,Main,Elder Zarude,0,0,0,,We no longer have \N any reason to reject you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.45,1:27:21.34,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Um... About that...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.34,1:27:22.74,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.91,1:27:26.12,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I want to go traveling!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.20,1:27:28.87,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.70,1:27:34.13,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,...that I want to go on a journey \N and become the bridge between humans and Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.13,1:27:36.40,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.40,1:27:38.40,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You mean \N you’re abandoning the jungle?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.40,1:27:41.12,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,No. I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.12,1:27:45.47,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I love both Pokémon and people! \N So I can help both!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.47,1:27:46.93,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.93,1:27:49.38,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You seriously think \N you can pull that off?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.38,1:27:52.06,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You are a Pokémon! \N The son of a Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.06,1:27:56.32,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,No! I am a human, a Pokémon, \N {\i1}and{\i0} your son!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.93,1:28:00.16,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Because you raised me, \N I know I can do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.52,1:28:02.12,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Just like you did!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.12,1:28:04.04,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Quit acting so tough!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.04,1:28:06.20,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m sure you’ll \N come home crying in no time!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.20,1:28:07.91,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I’ll make it! \N Just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.43,1:28:16.01,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.71,1:28:19.63,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.63,1:28:23.73,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Everyone, \N look after Dada for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.82,1:28:28.86,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.86,1:28:31.03,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.32,1:28:34.10,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,He’s serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.10,1:28:38.15,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,So there’s only one thing \N for his dad to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.65,1:28:41.15,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,My son is setting off!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.15,1:28:43.25,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you all! \N You remember what I said to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.25,1:28:43.91,Main,Zarudes,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.91,1:28:46.80,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,So, have you ever seen it?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.80,1:28:47.80,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.80,1:28:48.91,Main,Leader Zarude,0,0,0,,What’s it like?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.36,1:28:52.78,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,It’s... just like Koko said it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.98,1:29:23.99,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.94,1:29:25.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.60,1:29:29.52,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.41,1:29:32.41,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.36,1:29:34.87,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Koko gonna go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.87,1:29:37.37,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean you’re \N going on a journey?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.35,1:29:51.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That fall looked \N pretty rough, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.30,1:29:57.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What is it, Koko?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.90,1:30:02.25,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I... didn’t put these in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.75,1:30:20.17,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.26,1:30:30.61,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Dada...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.47,1:30:43.90,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Give it everything you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.00,1:30:47.93,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Become this \N “bridge between humans and Pokémon.”
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.56,1:30:50.21,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.24,1:30:52.48,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.48,1:30:53.71,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.55,1:30:58.23,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,You are my son! \N My pride and joy!{Best way I could think of to handle “jiman no musuko.” -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:04.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Koko?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.88,1:31:07.64,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,Satoshi. Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.00,1:31:10.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah! \N We’ll meet again out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.02,1:31:17.41,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,See ya, Koko!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.46,1:31:42.14,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,My name is Koko.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.14,1:31:46.17,Main,Koko,0,0,0,,I am a human, a Pokémon, \N and Dada’s son!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.27,1:32:00.18,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Anonymously posted vehicle camera footage \N of the accident from ten years ago,{I thought it was weird that flames were reflecting on Z’s glasses at 1:09:38, guess he recorded the crash and played it back to Koko -blu}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.18,1:32:03.69,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,as well as a recorded \N admission of guilt by Doctor Zed...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.69,1:32:06.44,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...appeared to be \N the conclusive pieces of evidence.{aka “Anonymous videos were all the proof you need to be locked up in the Pokémon world.” -blu}{Anonymous videos of the guy flat-out saying "I DID IT AND THIS IS WHY," though. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.44,1:32:08.86,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,In response, \N the Biotope Company...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.14,1:32:11.07,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.07,1:32:15.08,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,What’s wrong? \N You never call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.08,1:32:17.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Well... I just kinda wanted \N to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.96,1:32:20.71,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,What brought this on?! \N Did you eat something bad?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.71,1:32:22.16,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.16,1:32:24.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I’m fine...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.36,1:32:27.84,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Hey, don’t rush!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.84,1:32:31.01,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,There’s plenty of berries! \N It’s not like they’re gonna run away!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.95,1:32:42.06,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.59,1:32:44.64,Main,Dada Zarude,0,0,0,,Starting to look \N a little nicer here, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.80,1:32:53.63,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,This planet is filled with \N strange, strange creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.71,1:32:58.24,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,We humans and these creatures \N help each other out and live together...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.24,1:33:00.23,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,We may fight at times...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.23,1:33:03.98,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Or even become parent and child, \N despite not being related by blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.98,1:33:06.67,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,We live alongside them, \N united by all of these bonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.66,1:33:14.22,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,These creatures are as numerous \N as the dreams and adventures waiting out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.22,1:33:18.94,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,And they are known as \N Pocket Monsters, or for short...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.94,1:33:20.27,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:31.65,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}saa utae! Zarude!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:33.51,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}dare yori mo tsuyoku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:35.27,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}osore wa shinai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:39.76,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}warera mori no chi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.64,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}koe o agero!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:43.66,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}warera mori no chi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:45.52,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}koe o agero!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.57,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}tsuchi ni shimikomu mizu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.67,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}ki wa sodachi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:51.53,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}hi ni terasare
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:53.78,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}mori to naru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.17,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}kikoeru ka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:57.28,Okite no Kara,Okite no Uta - JP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}ooku no ashiato ga
