Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:48.96,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}The twinkling of the stars upon a rippling pool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:55.72,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}The dewdrops of the dawn make a forest symphony
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:18.98,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Resting in my palm, I could feel your lonely heartbeat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:25.48,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Both of us were as confused as one another
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:32.53,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Don't judge others by the patterns of their fur
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:38.78,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Don't let fear take over and bare your claws
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:42.22,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}I know that before long, you will grow tall
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.40,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}with thicker blood, and a deeper voice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:49.01,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Even your eyelashes tell a tale
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:53.32,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}They prove that you were here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:56.78,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}So ride upon the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:59.96,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Push through the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:03.63,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Soak up the light
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:07.12,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}And live on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:10.49,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Now, take my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:13.92,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Stomp into the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.35,Koko ENG,Koko - ENG,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Let your life's song
