Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.57,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,tansan no juice nonde puhhaa
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.57,0:27:35.38,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,okiniiri no ongaku de oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.38,0:27:39.57,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,jitensha no kago ni wa yume tsumekonde beautiful day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:43.13,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,mekurumeku jinsei o meippai
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.13,0:27:46.32,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,hi ga kureru made asobihoudai
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:53.47,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,hosou sareta machi no douro mo nukarunda kemonomichi mo
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.47,0:27:56.52,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,ichi milli demo fumidashite shimattara
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:28:00.71,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,zensokuryoku de kakenukeru dake
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:05.47,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,c'mon everybody irotoridori
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.47,0:28:09.99,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,niyaniya shichau you na paradise hajiketobou
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:16.17,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,kakkoii kawaii koko de wa daremo ga twinkle-twinkle star
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:19.71,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,everybody kokoro dokidoki
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:23.97,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,uzuuzu shichau you na tanoshii basho wa doko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.68,0:28:26.75,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,Show Window ni utsuru
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:30.31,Show Window Kara,Show Window -JP,0,0,0,,kimi kara sekai o kaeteyuke
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.57,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Down some fizzy juice and go ahh
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.57,0:27:35.38,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,My favorite music playing, oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.38,0:27:39.57,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Bike basket stuffed full of dreams, it's a beautiful day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:43.13,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,I'm gonna enjoy this dazzlingly bright life
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.13,0:27:46.32,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Playing all day until the sun goes down
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:53.47,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Going down paved city streets or muddy animal tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.47,0:27:56.52,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Once I've taken that first step, the very first millimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:28:00.71,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,all I can do is sprint non-stop until I make it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:05.47,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,C'mon everybody, decked out in color
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.47,0:28:09.99,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Here's a paradise that'll have ya grinning, let's raise the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:16.17,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Cute or cool, here everyone's a twinkle-twinkle star
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:19.71,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,Everybody, hearts all aflutter
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:23.97,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,I'm raring to go, so where's the party at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.68,0:28:26.75,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,See yourself in the show window
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:30.31,Show Window ENG,Show Window - ENG,0,0,0,,You can change the world, just start with yourself
